{
  "profile_id": "bge-large-semantic-auto-kmeans-v1",
  "corpora": [
    "backend/python/cluster-engine/artifacts/calibration/corpus/corpus_rule_categories.json",
    "backend/python/cluster-engine/artifacts/calibration/corpus/corpus_field_samples.json"
  ],
  "label_fields": ["l2", "l1"],
  "splits": ["calibration", "holdout"],
  "notes": [
    "本轮扫描的三条前提都来自实测，不是先验假设：",
    "① 必须在算法实际运行的聚类空间里扫。语料 967 < profile 的 pca_min_samples=2000 时降维被跳过，",
    "   原始 1024 维 BGE 空间的各向异性让 Auto-K 退化：80 个真实主题塌成 k=2、B-cubed F1 只有 0.061；",
    "   启用 PCA(64) 后同一批数据是 k=74、F1 0.417，且单次耗时从 22s 降到 4s。",
    "   因此扫描用 --profile-params 下调 pca_min_samples，并把覆盖值写进结果 JSON。",
    "② t_sem 不是单调旋钮，且响应面很不连续：",
    "   0.78 → k=2；0.80 → k=74；0.82 → k=69；0.84 → k=12。",
    "   机制是后处理的簇半径上限 r_max = min(1-t_sem, median+3*1.4826*MAD)：",
    "   t_sem 降低会让 1-t_sem 变成主约束，成员被无差别吸进最近的簇。",
    "   所以可行窗口只有 [0.80, 0.82]，本轮在该窗口内加密到 0.01。",
    "③ t_single 在本语料上不起作用：单主题分支要求 loo_q10 >= t_single，",
    "   而实测 loo_q10 = 0.587，远低于任何候选值，因此 K=1 分支从未触发。",
    "   它的取值保留现状，并在报告里声明「本轮未校准」。",
    "阈值本身仍然只落 semantic-calibration-v1.json；覆盖值只影响扫描口径。"
  ],
  "stages": [
    {
      "name": "r1-t_pair",
      "from": "baseline",
      "mode": "oat",
      "values": { "t_pair": [0.30, 0.40, 0.45, 0.50, 0.55, 0.60, 0.65] }
    },
    {
      "name": "r2-t_sem",
      "from": "best",
      "mode": "oat",
      "values": { "t_sem": [0.79, 0.80, 0.81, 0.82] }
    },
    {
      "name": "r3-t_merge",
      "from": "best",
      "mode": "oat",
      "values": { "t_merge": [0.82, 0.84, 0.86, 0.88, 0.90] }
    },
    {
      "name": "r4-t_single",
      "from": "best",
      "mode": "oat",
      "values": { "t_single": [0.80, 0.82, 0.84, 0.85] }
    },
    {
      "name": "r5-grid-sem-merge",
      "from": "best",
      "mode": "grid",
      "values": {
        "t_sem": [0.79, 0.80, 0.81, 0.82],
        "t_merge": [0.84, 0.86, 0.88]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "r6-grid-pair-merge",
      "from": "best",
      "mode": "grid",
      "values": {
        "t_pair": [0.40, 0.45, 0.50],
        "t_merge": [0.84, 0.86, 0.88]
      }
    }
  ]
}
